比如疫苗研发？

480
00:24:02,650 --> 00:24:04,770
Or do you want to destroy it
或者你希望把它灭活，

481
00:24:04,770 --> 00:24:09,770
and maintain it in the storage as a DNA or RNA,
以适合分析的DNA或RNA形式

482
00:24:10,170 --> 00:24:12,410
which is suitable for analysis?
保存起来？

483
00:24:12,410 --> 00:24:21,420
Section nine focuses on regulatory and other information.
第九部分着重讲法规和其他信息。

484
00:24:21,940 --> 00:24:26,940
This information must be included in your PhDs.
这些信息必须写进你们的PSDS中。

