输入你的生物因子的正确名称，

503
00:25:20,460 --> 00:25:22,480
for example, Bacillus anthracis,
例如炭疽芽孢杆菌，

504
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:26,780
and then you search for all of these information
然后在PSDS中

505
00:25:26,780 --> 00:25:32,940
in the PhDs itself.
检索所有这些信息。

506
00:25:32,940 --> 00:25:35,380
This brings us to the end of this particular lecture.
本讲到此结束。

507
00:25:35,380 --> 00:25:36,420
So in this lecture,
在这一讲中，

508
00:25:36,420 --> 00:25:39,380
