我们重点讲了以世卫组织《实验室生物安全手册》为参考的

509
00:25:39,380 --> 00:25:42,180
using the WHO-LBM as a reference.
微生物风险评估。

510
00:25:42,180 --> 00:25:44,740
We have understood the scope of risk assessment
我们理解了风险评估的范围，

511
00:25:44,740 --> 00:25:47,420
as I indicated in the iceberg example.
就像我在冰山例子中说明的那样。

512
00:25:47,420 --> 00:25:49,500
There are certain risks which are seen
有些风险是可见的，

513
00:25:49,500 --> 00:25:51,860
and certain risks which are unseen.
有些风险是不可见的。

514
00:25:51,860 --> 00:25:56,860
And no matter how exhaustive the virus management strategy
无论生物风险管理策略多么详尽，

515
00:25:57,900 --> 00:26:00,100
may be, there'll be always be certain risks
总会有一些你无法预测的

516
00:26:00,100 --> 00:26:02,540
which you cannot predict.
风险。

517
00:26:02,540 --> 00:26:04,380
However, your role as a virus manager
不过，你作为生物风险管理者的职责

518
00:26:04,380 --> 00:26:08,180
is to ensure that the risk assessment is thorough
是确保风险评估做到全面

519
00:26:08,180 --> 00:26:09,880
and comprehensive.
彻底。

520
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:12,820
We have also looked at the Pathogen Safety Data Sheet.
我们还了解了病原体安全数据表。

